{"arch":[{"q":"Q4413257","n":"Bertel Strömmer","c":16,"b":"1890","d":"1962","wiki":"Bertel_Strömmer","bio":"Tampereen kaupunginarkkitehti vuosina 1918–1953, ja ennen sitä kolme vuotta apulaiskaupunginarkkitehti. Hän suunnitteli reilusti yli sata rakennusta, joista suurin osa on Tampereella. Tunnetuimpia ovat Hotelli Tammer ja funkkistyylinen linja-autoasema. Innokkaalta valokuvaajalta jäi noin 10 000 negatiivia, jotka ovat nykyään Tampere-Seuran hallussa.","img":{"f":"img/a3459eb217.jpg","t":"Tampereen linja-autoasema","y":"1938","a":"E.M. Staf","org":"Vapriikin kuva-arkisto","lic":"CC BY 4.0","url":"https://www.finna.fi/Record/siiri.urn%3Anbn%3Afi-vapriikkihttp%253A%252F%252Fmuseosiiri.tampere.fi%253A8080%252FVALOKUVA%252Fcontent%252FSIR_EXEC%252Fimages%252Fprimary%252F2003100108%252F10649853194360.jpg"},"en":{"bio":"City architect of Tampere 1918–1953, and before that deputy city architect for three years. He designed well over a hundred buildings, most of them in Tampere. The best known are Hotel Tammer and the functionalist bus station. A keen photographer, he left about 10,000 negatives, now held by the Tampere Society.","cap":"Tampere bus station"}},{"q":"Q2783024","n":"F. L. Calonius","c":14,"b":"1833","d":"1903","wiki":"F._L._Calonius","bio":"Tampereen ensimmäinen kaupunginarkkitehti vuosina 1876–1891. Hän laati asemakaavat Amurille, Tammelaan ja Kyttälään ja suunnitteli uusrenessanssityylisiä puu- ja kivitaloja. Tunnetuimpia ovat Finlaysonin kirkko, Plevnan kutomo sekä Keskustorin Sandbergin ja Selinin talot.","img":{"f":"img/e4df8e7868.jpg","t":"Finlaysonin kirkko","y":"1926","a":"Hannu Rantakallio","org":"Vapriikin kuva-arkisto","lic":"CC BY 4.0","url":"https://www.finna.fi/Record/siiri.urn%3Anbn%3Afi-vapriikkihttp%253A%252F%252Fmuseosiiri.tampere.fi%253A8080%252FVALOKUVA%252Fcontent%252FSIR_EXEC%252Fimages%252Fprimary%252F2003092912%252F10648267942180.jpg"},"en":{"bio":"Tampere's first city architect 1876–1891. He drew up town plans for Amuri, Tammela and Kyttälä and designed Neo-Renaissance wooden and stone buildings. The best known are the Finlayson church, the Plevna weaving mill and the Sandberg and Selin buildings on the Central Square.","cap":"Finlayson church"}},{"q":"Q377421","n":"Birger Federley","c":11,"b":"1874","d":"1935","wiki":"Birger_Federley","bio":"Helsinkiläissyntyinen arkkitehti perusti toimistonsa Tampereelle 1898 ja oli kaupunginarkkitehtina 1900–1901. Hänen tyylinsä vaihtui jugendista sodan jälkeen klassismiin. Federley opetti Tampereen teknillisessä opistossa ja istui kaupunginvaltuustossa. Hänen töitään ovat esimerkiksi Tirkkosen talo, Kansallispankin talo ja Aamulehden talo.","en":{"bio":"Born in Helsinki, he founded his office in Tampere in 1898 and was city architect in 1900–1901. His style moved from Art Nouveau to Classicism after the war. Federley taught at the Tampere technical institute and sat on the city council. His works include the Tirkkonen building, the Kansallispankki building and the Aamulehti building."}},{"q":"Q6109593","n":"Jaakko Tähtinen","c":9,"b":"1904","d":"1970","wiki":"Jaakko_Tähtinen","bio":"Tamperelainen arkkitehti, joka suunnitteli suuren osan kaupungin asuin- ja toimistotaloista 1930–60-luvuilla. Hänen päätyönään pidetään vuonna 1965 valmistunutta Hakametsän jäähallia. Hänen poikansa Antti Tähtinen jatkoi toimiston työtä.","img":{"f":"img/2650868066.jpg","t":"Hakametsän jäähalli","y":"1967","a":"Veikko Lintinen","org":"Vapriikin kuva-arkisto","lic":"CC BY 4.0","url":"https://www.finna.fi/Record/siiri.urn%3Anbn%3Afi-vapriikkihttp%253A%252F%252Fwww.profium.com%252Farchive%252FArchivedObject-E8131035-39B7-275E-52BB-F829B3F9515D"},"en":{"bio":"A Tampere architect who designed many of the city's residential and office buildings from the 1930s to the 1960s. His main work is considered to be the Hakametsä ice rink, completed in 1965. His son Antti Tähtinen continued the office's work.","cap":"Hakametsä ice rink"}},{"q":"Q3737312","n":"Wivi Lönn","c":9,"b":"1872","d":"1966","wiki":"Wivi_Lönn","bio":"Tamperelaissyntyinen Lönn oli Suomen ensimmäinen naisarkkitehti, joka perusti oman toimiston. Hänen tunnetuimmat tamperelaistyönsä ovat keskuspaloasema ja entinen suomalainen tyttökoulu. Hän suunnitteli yli 30 koulua ja useita tehtaita, ja Armas Lindgrenin kanssa esimerkiksi Tallinnan Estonia-teatterin.","img":{"f":"img/0a98cd1311.jpg","t":"Tampereen keskuspaloasema","y":"1907","a":"Werner Gestrin","org":"Vapriikin kuva-arkisto","lic":"CC BY 4.0","url":"https://www.finna.fi/Record/siiri.urn%3Anbn%3Afi-vapriikkihttp%253A%252F%252Fwww.profium.com%252Farchive%252FArchivedObject-C4F953BF-722D-BCDC-F703-2EE952245A9A"},"en":{"bio":"Born in Tampere, Lönn was the first woman architect in Finland to found her own office. Her best-known works in Tampere are the central fire station and the former Finnish girls' school. She designed over 30 schools and several factories, and with Armas Lindgren, for example, the Estonia Theatre in Tallinn.","cap":"Tampere central fire station"}},{"q":"Q3101331","n":"Georg Schreck","c":7,"b":"1859","d":"1925","wiki":"Georg_Schreck","bio":"Hämeenlinnassa syntynyt Schreck asettui Tampereelle ja toimi arkkitehdin lisäksi rakennusurakoitsijana ja liikemiehenä. Hän suunnitteli Keskustorin raatihuoneen (1890), Pyynikin puisen näkötornin (1888) ja monia Tampellan rakennuksia, esimerkiksi Tampellan juhlatalon.","img":{"f":"img/f4733e26e5.jpg","t":"Tampereen Raatihuone","y":"1890","a":"Jokinen, Martti","org":"Rakennushistorian kuvakokoelma","lic":"CC BY 4.0","url":"https://www.finna.fi/Record/museovirasto.2C655674DCE0279FDFC8E11E1D1FCF31","w":822,"h":1200,"lm":"Keskustori 10|2004"},"en":{"bio":"Born in Hämeenlinna, Schreck settled in Tampere and worked as a building contractor and businessman as well as an architect. He designed the city hall on the Central Square (1890), the wooden Pyynikki observation tower (1888) and many Tampella buildings, such as the Tampella festival hall.","cap":"Tampere City Hall"}},{"q":"Q3417698","n":"Raili Pietilä","c":7,"b":"1926","d":"2021","wiki":"Raili_Pietilä","bio":"Raili ja Reima Pietilä työskentelivät yhdessä 1960-luvulta alkaen. Heidän yhteisiä töitään ovat Dipoli, Kalevan kirkko, Hervannan keskus, Tampereen pääkirjasto Metso ja presidentin virka-asunto Mäntyniemi.","img":{"f":"img/f5f548b8c2.jpg","t":"Kalevan kirkko","y":"1967","a":"Kanerva, Teuvo","org":"Historian kuvakokoelma","lic":"CC BY 4.0","url":"https://www.finna.fi/Record/museovirasto.D8CCBBD90FDF2B717A3D13ADA86E87F0","w":1185,"h":1200,"lm":"Liisanpuisto 1|1966"},"en":{"bio":"Raili and Reima Pietilä worked together from the 1960s onwards. Their joint works include Dipoli, Kaleva Church, the Hervanta centre, the Metso main library in Tampere and Mäntyniemi, the President's official residence.","cap":"Kaleva Church"}},{"q":"Q2582922","n":"Reima Pietilä","c":7,"b":"1923","d":"1993","wiki":"Reima_Pietilä","bio":"Reima ja Raili Pietilä suunnittelivat yhdessä Tampereelle Kalevan kirkon, Hervannan keskuksen ja pääkirjasto Metson. Reima Pietilä oli myös Oulun yliopiston arkkitehtuurin professori 1973–1979.","img":{"f":"img/f5f548b8c2.jpg","t":"Kalevan kirkko","y":"1967","a":"Kanerva, Teuvo","org":"Historian kuvakokoelma","lic":"CC BY 4.0","url":"https://www.finna.fi/Record/museovirasto.D8CCBBD90FDF2B717A3D13ADA86E87F0","w":1185,"h":1200,"lm":"Liisanpuisto 1|1966"},"en":{"bio":"Reima and Raili Pietilä designed Kaleva Church, the Hervanta centre and the Metso main library in Tampere. Reima Pietilä was also professor of architecture at the University of Oulu 1973–1979.","cap":"Kaleva Church"}},{"q":"Q14482233","n":"Lambert Petterson","c":5,"b":"1864","d":"1938","wiki":"Lambert_Petterson","bio":"Petterson oli Tampereen kaupunginarkkitehti Caloniuksen jälkeen ensin vt:nä 1891–1900 ja vakinaisena 1902–1918. Hänen aikanaan kaupungin rakentaminen kiihtyi ja rakennustavat muuttuivat. Hän suunnitteli muun muassa Finlaysonin palatsin ja Finlaysonin pääkonttorin.","img":{"f":"img/99421f8e43.jpg","t":"Finlaysonin palatsi","y":"2023","a":"Saarni Säilynoja","org":"Vapriikin kuva-arkisto","lic":"CC BY 4.0","url":"https://www.finna.fi/Record/siiri.urn%3Anbn%3Afi-vapriikkihttp%253A%252F%252Fwww.profium.com%252Farchive%252FArchivedObject-3664B9C2-9CBC-1AE2-2D92-677B559B0B7F","w":800,"h":533,"lm":"Kuninkaankatu 1|1920"},"en":{"bio":"Petterson was Tampere's city architect after Calonius, first acting in 1891–1900 and permanently in 1902–1918. In his time construction in the city accelerated and building methods changed. He designed the Finlayson Palace and Finlayson's head office, among others.","cap":"Finlayson Palace"}},{"q":"Q11861661","n":"Harry W. Schreck","c":4,"b":"1904","d":"1995","wiki":"Harry_W._Schreck","bio":"Arkkitehti, joka perusti oman toimistonsa Tampereelle 1936 ja johti sitä vuoteen 1990. Hänen töitään ovat esimerkiksi Kalevan tornit ja Tampereen Säästöpankin talo.","en":{"bio":"An architect who founded his own office in Tampere in 1936 and ran it until 1990. His works include the Kaleva towers and the Tampere Savings Bank building."}},{"q":"Q11885310","n":"Olavi Suvitie","c":4,"b":"1926","d":"2026","wiki":"Olavi_Suvitie","bio":"Tamperelainen arkkitehti, joka työskenteli kymmenen vuotta kaupungilla ja sitten Taito Uusitalon kanssa yhteisessä toimistossa. Hän suunnitteli paljon koteja ja kouluja, mutta näkyvimpiä ovat Tesoman, Hervannan ja Peltolammin vesitornit sekä Tesoman kirkko.","img":{"f":"img/4ae0734a19.jpg","t":"Näkymä Tesomajärvenkadun kerrostaloalueelle ja Tesoman vesitorni","y":"1970","a":"Veikko Lintinen","org":"Vapriikin kuva-arkisto","lic":"CC BY 4.0","url":"https://www.finna.fi/Record/siiri.urn%3Anbn%3Afi-vapriikkihttp%253A%252F%252Fwww.profium.com%252Farchive%252FArchivedObject-746BEB07-1DE1-62AE-6FB8-2A1BB60AB840","cap":"Tesoman vesitorni kerrostalojen takana (1970)"},"en":{"bio":"A Tampere architect who worked for the city for ten years and then in a joint office with Taito Uusitalo. He designed many homes and schools, but his most visible works are the water towers of Tesoma, Hervanta and Peltolammi and Tesoma church.","cap":"Tesoma water tower behind apartment blocks (1970)"}},{"q":"Q11853361","n":"August Krook","c":3,"b":"1860","d":"1935","wiki":"August_Krook","bio":"Novgorodissa syntynyt Krook oli Tampereen kaupunginarkkitehti 1896–1897 ja tunnettiin jugendrakennuksistaan. Tampereella lähes kaikki hänen työnsä on purettu. Täällä hänen tunnetuin työnsä on Ruotsalainen yhteiskoulu.","img":{"f":"img/efd5974c54.jpg","t":"Ruotsalainen yhteiskoulu","y":"1900","a":"","org":"Vapriikin kuva-arkisto","lic":"CC BY 4.0","url":"https://www.finna.fi/Record/siiri.urn%3Anbn%3Afi-vapriikkihttp%253A%252F%252Fmuseosiiri.tampere.fi%253A8080%252FVALOKUVA%252Fcontent%252FSIR_EXEC%252Fimages%252Fprimary%252F20061026%252F11618441653440.jpg"},"en":{"bio":"Born in Novgorod, Krook was Tampere's city architect in 1896–1897 and known for his Art Nouveau buildings. Almost all his work in Tampere has been demolished; his best-known building here is the Swedish co-educational school.","cap":"The Swedish co-educational school"}},{"q":"Q102185901","n":"Taito Uusitalo","c":3,"b":"1922","d":"2023","wiki":"Taito_Uusitalo","bio":"Tamperelainen arkkitehti, joka johti yhteistä toimistoa Olavi Suvitien kanssa 1957–1986. Toimisto suunnitteli muun muassa Peltolammin vesitornin ja Tampereen ateljeetalon.","img":{"f":"img/4ae0734a19.jpg","t":"Näkymä Tesomajärvenkadun kerrostaloalueelle ja Tesoman vesitorni","y":"1970","a":"Veikko Lintinen","org":"Vapriikin kuva-arkisto","lic":"CC BY 4.0","url":"https://www.finna.fi/Record/siiri.urn%3Anbn%3Afi-vapriikkihttp%253A%252F%252Fwww.profium.com%252Farchive%252FArchivedObject-746BEB07-1DE1-62AE-6FB8-2A1BB60AB840","cap":"Tesoman vesitorni kerrostalojen takana (1970)"},"en":{"bio":"A Tampere architect who ran a joint office with Olavi Suvitie from 1957 to 1986. The office designed the Peltolammi water tower and the Tampere studio building, among others.","cap":"Tesoma water tower behind apartment blocks (1970)"}},{"q":"Q56403810","n":"Veikko Kallio","c":3,"b":"1893","d":"1973","wiki":"Veikko_Kallio_(arkkitehti)","bio":"Karkussa syntynyt rakennusinsinööri ja arkkitehti, joka työskenteli Birger Federleyn toimistossa ennen kuin perusti oman toimistonsa 1926. Hänen töitään ovat Haapasen huvila Pyynikinrinteellä ja Tampereen ensimmäinen ”pilvenpiirtäjä”, Karhu-apteekin talo.","en":{"bio":"A civil engineer and architect born in Karkku who worked in Birger Federley's office before founding his own in 1926. His works include Villa Haapanen on Pyynikinrinne and Tampere's first “skyscraper”, the Karhu pharmacy building."}},{"q":"Q86212254","n":"Vilho Kolho","c":3,"b":"1891","d":"1988","wiki":"Vilho_Kolho","bio":"Tampereen ensimmäinen apulaiskaupunginarkkitehti vuodesta 1927. Yhdessä kurssitoverinsa Bertel Strömmerin kanssa hän johti kaupungin rakentamista vuosikymmeniä. Tunnetuimpia töitä ovat Pyynikin näkötorni ja Kaupin vanha vesitorni.","img":{"f":"img/0eec43df1f.jpg","t":"Pyynikin näkötorni","y":"1929","a":"Hannu Rantakallio","org":"Vapriikin kuva-arkisto","lic":"CC BY 4.0","url":"https://www.finna.fi/Record/siiri.urn%3Anbn%3Afi-vapriikkihttp%253A%252F%252Fmuseosiiri.tampere.fi%253A8080%252FVALOKUVA%252Fcontent%252FSIR_EXEC%252Fimages%252Fprimary%252F2003092911%252F10648237964970.jpg","w":350,"h":544,"lm":"Näkötornintie 20|1920"},"en":{"bio":"Tampere's first deputy city architect from 1927. Together with his fellow student Bertel Strömmer he led the city's building for decades. His best-known works are the Pyynikki observation tower and the old Kauppi water tower.","cap":"Pyynikki observation tower"}},{"q":"Q30605008","n":"Antti Tähtinen","c":2,"b":"1935","d":"2017","wiki":"Antti_Tähtinen_(arkkitehti)"},{"q":"Q66124714","n":"Arthur af Hällström","c":2,"b":"1867","d":"1933","wiki":"Arthur_af_Hällström","bio":"Lempäälässä syntynyt arkkitehti, joka suunnitteli Tampereelle muun muassa Hällströmin palatsin (1897) ja Laukonkulman (1901).","en":{"bio":"An architect born in Lempäälä who designed, among others, the Hällström palace (1897) and Laukonkulma (1901) in Tampere."}},{"q":"Q77103","n":"Carl Ludvig Engel","c":2,"b":"1778","d":"1840","wiki":"Carl_Ludvig_Engel","bio":"Berliiniläissyntyinen Engel loi Helsingin empirekeskustan ja ohjasi koko suomalaista rakennustaidetta 1800-luvun alkupuolella. Tampereella häneltä on säilynyt Vanhan kirkon kellotapuli (1828–29).","img":{"f":"img/018e3c4427.jpg","t":"Tampereen vanha kirkko ja kellotapuli","y":"1885","a":"Svante Lagergrén","org":"Vapriikin kuva-arkisto","lic":"CC BY 4.0","url":"https://www.finna.fi/Record/siiri.urn%3Anbn%3Afi-vapriikkihttp%253A%252F%252Fmuseosiiri.tampere.fi%253A8080%252FVALOKUVA%252Fcontent%252FSIR_EXEC%252Fimages%252Fprimary%252F2003092913%252F10648300870300.jpg","w":800,"h":528,"lm":"Keskustori 6|1920"},"en":{"bio":"Born in Berlin, Engel created the Empire centre of Helsinki and guided Finnish architecture in the early 19th century. In Tampere, the bell tower of the Old Church (1828–29) survives from him.","cap":"Tampere Old Church and bell tower"}},{"q":"Q3129431","n":"Heikki Siren","c":2,"b":"1918","d":"2013","wiki":"Heikki_Siren"},{"q":"Q3191952","n":"Kaija Siren","c":2,"b":"1920","d":"2001","wiki":"Kaija_Siren"},{"q":"Q937984","n":"Lars Sonck","c":2,"b":"1870","d":"1956","wiki":"Lars_Sonck","bio":"Kansallisromantiikan merkittävimpiä arkkitehteja Eliel Saarisen ohella. Tampereella hänen päätyönsä on graniittinen tuomiokirkko (1902–1907), jonka hän suunnitteli 1900-luvun alussa.","img":{"f":"img/6ca3488629.jpg","t":"Tampereen tuomiokirkko","y":"1940","a":"Werner Mauritz Gestrin","org":"Vapriikin kuva-arkisto","lic":"CC BY 4.0","url":"https://www.finna.fi/Record/siiri.urn%3Anbn%3Afi-vapriikkihttp%253A%252F%252Fmuseosiiri.tampere.fi%253A8080%252FVALOKUVA%252Fcontent%252FSIR_EXEC%252Fimages%252Fprimary%252F20100219%252F12665710344480.jpg","w":800,"h":786,"lm":"Tuomiokirkonkatu 3b|1907"},"en":{"bio":"One of the most important architects of National Romanticism alongside Eliel Saarinen. In Tampere his main work is the granite cathedral (1902–1907), which he designed in the early 20th century.","cap":"Tampere Cathedral"}},{"q":"Q5413869","n":"Pekka Ilveskoski","c":2,"b":"1931","d":"1987","wiki":"Pekka_Ilveskoski","bio":"Tamperelainen arkkitehti, jolla oli oma toimisto kaupungissa. Hänen tunnetuin työnsä on Näsinneula (1971).","img":{"f":"img/81e3459ac6.jpg","t":"Näsinneula","y":"1971","a":"Kanerva, Teuvo","org":"Historian kuvakokoelma","lic":"CC BY 4.0","url":"https://www.finna.fi/Record/museovirasto.596A703830183971F2024C0D6109AC43","w":1193,"h":1200,"lm":"Särkänniemenraitti 3|0"},"en":{"bio":"A Tampere architect with his own office in the city. His best-known work is Näsinneula (1971).","cap":"Näsinneula"}},{"q":"Q698961","n":"Timo Penttilä","c":2,"b":"1931","d":"2011","wiki":"Timo_Penttilä","bio":"Tamperelaissyntyinen Penttilä kuuluu Suomen merkittävimpiin modernistisiin arkkitehteihin. Tampereella hänen töitään ovat Ratinan stadion (1965) ja ravintola Koskipuisto (1966).","en":{"bio":"Born in Tampere, Penttilä is one of Finland's most important modernist architects. His works in Tampere include Ratina Stadium (1965) and the Koskipuisto restaurant (1966)."}},{"q":"Q63093327","n":"Vihtori Heikkilä","c":2,"b":"1868","d":"1923","wiki":"Vihtori_Heikkilä"},{"q":"Q2820019","n":"Aarne Ervi","c":1,"b":"1910","d":"1977","wiki":"Aarne_Ervi"},{"q":"Q2857046","n":"Anton Wilhelm Arppe","c":1,"b":"1789","d":"1862","wiki":"Anton_Wilhelm_Arppe"},{"q":"Q47542025","n":"Antti Nousjoki","c":1,"b":"1974","wiki":"Antti_Nousjoki"},{"q":"Q126372851","n":"Arco Architecture Company","c":1,"wiki":"Arco_Architecture_Company"},{"q":"Q11854129","n":"Berndt Blom","c":1,"b":"1868","d":"1932","wiki":"Berndt_Blom"},{"q":"Q51845698","n":"Bertel Gripenberg","c":1,"b":"1920","d":"2013","wiki":"Bertel_Gripenberg_(arkkitehti)"},{"q":"Q4355746","n":"Bertel Jung","c":1,"b":"1872","d":"1946","wiki":"Bertel_Jung"},{"q":"Q993300","n":"Bruno Granholm","c":1,"b":"1857","d":"